18:T486,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the Italy university application deadline for 2027?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no single national deadline. Each university and programme publishes its own calls, and applicant category can change which round is available."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When did Padua applications open for 2027–2028?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The University of Padua states that the first call for most programmes opened on 15 September 2026 and closes on 15 November 2026. Check the exact programme for exceptions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can non-EU students apply in the last call?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not always. Some later calls are limited to EU applicants or non-EU applicants already resident in Italy, so verify the category written in the official call."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the scholarship deadline the same as admission?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Often it is separate and can be earlier. Track admission and every funding application independently."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/italy-university-application-deadlines/\",\"name\":\"Italy university application deadlines for 2027 entry\",\"description\":\"Compare selected Italy university application deadlines for 2027 entry. Separate admission rounds, scholarship forms, language evidence and pre-enrolment.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/italy-university-application-deadlines/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-02\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-21\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/ima